    "body": "The “similar to” phrasing may have intended to acknowledge that — but I agree that it seems confusing to have pseudo-idl in the idl spec itself (not very friendly for folks not already familiar enough to know it’s not meant to be valid).\r\n\r\nGiven the original productions are still explicitly part of the grammar in this PR, I don’t think this framing is needed anyway.",
